        "source": "usage.md:43-48; README.md:65-70; note: the charter's own output format (.claude/agents/savante.md:107-116) labels four of the five — VERDICT, RATIONALE, CONDITIONS, RISKS WATCHED — and carries FINDINGS in prose; the labeled five-field form is the docs' statement"
